t type time), 人数 (input type number), 备注 (textarea). Button \"提交预订\". Use form action=\"#\" method=\"post\". Add simple JS validation maybe.\n\n- Ensure CSS for layout.\n\nAbout.html:\n\n- Title: \"关于家味餐厅\"\n\n- Story: \"创立于2015年...\" etc.\n\nMake sure relative links: index -> about.html (href=\"about.html\").\n\nAlso ensure no absolute URLs.\n\nNow design CSS: set container max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; Use flex for nav.\n\nMake responsive: use media queries for <768px to stack.\n\nBut keep simple.\n\nNow produce final answer with file separators.\n\nNeed to ensure each file content is inside the delimiters.\n\nLet's craft.\n\nFile: index.html\n\nWe'll embed style.\n\nLet's write.",
  "content": "===== FILE: index.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>家味餐厅 - 杭州浙菜家庭餐厅</title>\n    <style>\n        body{font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;color:#333;background:#f9f9f9;}\n        .container{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:20px;}\n        header{text-align:center;padding:20px 0;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;}\n        header h1{margin:0;font-size:2.2em;color:#d32f2f;}\n        nav{margin-top:10px;}\n        nav a{margin:0 15px;text-decoration:none;color:#d32f2f;font-weight:bold;}\n        .hero{position:relative;background:url('https://via.placeholder.com/1600x600?text=美味浙菜') no-repeat center/cover;height:400px;margin:30px 0;}\n        .hero::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.4);}\n        .hero .content{position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);color:#fff;text-align:center;}\n        .hero .content h2{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:2em;}\n        .hero .content p{margin:0;font-size:1.1em;}\n        .btn{display:inline-block;margin:15px 10px;padding:12px 25px;background:#d32f2f;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;font-size:1em;}\n        .section{margin:40px 0;background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:5px;box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);}\n        footer{text-align:center;padding:20px 0;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #e0e0e0;color:#666;font-size:0.9em;}\n        @media (max-width:768px){\n            .hero{height:250px;}\n            .hero .content h2{font-size:1.5em;}\n            nav a{display:block;margin:10px 0;}\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <header>\n        <h1>家味餐厅</h1>\n        <nav>\n            <a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n            <a href=\"menu.html\">菜单</a>\n            <a href=\"reservation.html\">预订座位</a>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"hero\">\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <h2>正宗浙江菜·温馨家庭餐厅</h2>\n            <p>让您在杭州也能享受到家的味道，品味地道浙味。</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n        <h2>欢迎光临</h2>\n        <p>家味餐厅坐落于杭州市中心，致力于为本地家庭、上班族和游客提供正宗的浙江家常菜。我们坚持使用本地新鲜食材，匠心烹饪每一道菜，让您在轻松的用餐环境中感受浙江的风味与温情。</p>\n        <p>我们的招牌菜包括西湖醋鱼、龙井虾仁、绍兴醉鸡以及多款季节性小菜，价格亲民，份量十足。无论是家庭聚餐、商务午餐还是旅游观光，家味餐厅都是您的不二选择。</p>\n        <a href=\"menu.html\" class=\"btn\">查看菜单</a>\n        <a href=\"reservation.html\" class=\"btn\">预订座位</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer>\n        地址：杭州市西湖区文三路18号<br>\n        电话：0571-1234-5678<br>\n        营业时间：11:00-22:00\n    </footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: about.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>关于家味餐厅</title>\n    <style>\n        body{font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;color:#333;background:#f9f9f9;}\n        .container{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:20px;}\n        header{text-align:center;padding:20px 0;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;}\n        header h1{margin:0;font-size:2.2em;color:#d32f2f;}\n        nav{margin-top:10px;}\n        nav a{margin:0 15px;text-decoration:none;color:#d32f2f;font-weight:bold;}\n        .section{margin:40px 0;background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:5px;box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);}\n        footer{text-align:center;padding:20px 0;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #e0e0e0;color:#666;font-size:0.9em;}\n        @media (max-width:768px){\n            nav a{display:block;margin:10px 0;}\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <header>\n        <h1>关于家味餐厅</h1>\n        <nav>\n            <a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n            <a href=\"menu.html\">菜单</a>\n            <a href=\"reservation.html\">预订座位</a>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n        <h2>我们的故事</h2>\n        <p>家味餐厅创立于2015年，由一位热爱烹饪的浙江本地人在杭州市中心创办。最初仅有两张桌子和几道家传菜式，经过不懈努力，逐步发展为一家集传统浙菜与现代餐饮理念的家庭餐厅。</p>\n        <p>我们的理念是“让每位顾客感受到家的温暖”。因此，我们坚持使用本地季节性食材，保持菜品的原汁原味；同时，我们注重服务细节，让每位来访的客人都能在轻松愉快的氛围中享受美食。</p>\n        <p>餐厅内部装饰简约大方，兼具传统江南水乡的雅致与现代简约的舒适，适合家庭聚餐、公司团建以及旅游观光的歇息。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer>\n        © 2025 家味餐厅 · 版权所有\n    </footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: menu.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>家味餐厅菜单</title>\n    <style>\n        body{font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;color:#333;background:#f9f9f9;}\n        .container{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:20px;}\n        header{text-align:center;padding:20px 0;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;}\n        header h1{margin:0;font-size:2.2em;color:#d32f2f;}\n        nav{margin-top:10px;}\n        nav a{margin:0 15px;text-decoration:none;color:#d32f2f;font-weight:bold;}\n        .section{margin:40px 0;background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:5px;box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);}\n        .category{margin-bottom:20px;}\n        .category h3{margin-top:0;color:#d32f2f;}\n        .dish{margin:10px 0;padding-left:20px;border-left:2px solid #e0e0e0;}\n        .dish span{display:block;}\n        .price{color:#d32f2f;font-weight:bold;}\n        footer{text-align:center;padding:20px 0;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #e0e0e0;color:#666;font-size:0.9em;}\n        @media (max-width:768px){\n            .container{padding:10px;}\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <header>\n        <h1>家味餐厅菜单</h1>\n        <nav>\n            <a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n            <a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n            <a href=\"reservation.html\">预订座位</a>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n        <h2>热菜</h2>\n        <div class=\"category\">\n            <h3>西湖醋鱼</h3>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><span>清蒸鲜鱼配酸汤</span><span class=\"price\">88元</span></div>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><span>采用当日捕获的银鱼，酸甜味道层次丰富</span></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"category\">\n            <h3>龙井虾仁</h3>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><span>精选淡水虾，裹上鲜香龙井叶</span><span class=\"price\">68元</span></div>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><span>鲜虾弹牙，龙井香气沁人</span></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"category\">\n            <h3>绍兴醉鸡</h3>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><span>本地土鸡慢炖，醉入绍兴酒香</span><span class=\"price\">78元</span></div>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><span>肉质鲜嫩，酒香渗透入味</span></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n        <h2>凉菜</h2>\n        <div class=\"category\">\n            <h3>凉拌黄瓜</h3>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><span>清脆黄瓜片，蒜蓉辣椒调味</span><span class=\"price\">18元</span></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"category\">\n            <h3>皮蛋瘦肉粥</h3>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><span>细腻粥底，皮蛋与瘦肉相互融合</span><span class=\"price\">28元</span></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"category\">\n            <h3>葱油拌面</h3>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><span>手工面条，葱油香气扑鼻</span><span class=\"price\">22元</span></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n        <h2>主食 & 甜点</h2>\n        <div class=\"category\">\n            <h3>蒸茶蛋</h3>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><span>软硬适中，香气悠长</span><span class=\"price\">12元</span></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"category\">\n            <h3>红糖糍粑</h3>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><span>糯米糍粑裹上浓郁红糖</span><span class=\"price\">15元</span></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"category\">\n            <h3>水果拼盘</h3>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><span>时令水果，清爽解腻</span><span class=\"price\">38元</span></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer>\n        地址：杭州市西湖区文三路18号 | 电话：0571-1234-5678\n    </footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: reservation.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>家味餐厅 - 预订座位</title>\n    <style>\n        body{font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;color:#333;background:#f9f9f9;}\n        .container{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:20px;}\n        header{text-align:center;padding:20px 0;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;}\n        header h1{margin:0;font-size:2.2em;color:#d32f2f;}\n        nav{margin-top:10px;}\n        nav a{margin:0 15px;text-decoration:none;color:#d32f2f;font-weight:bold;}\n        .section{margin:40px 0;background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:5px;box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);}\n        form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;max-width:600px;margin:auto;}\n        label{margin-top:15px;font-weight:bold;}\n        input, textarea{padding:8px;margin-top:5px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:4px;}\n        .btn{margin-top:20px;padding:12px 20px;background:#d32f2f;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;font-size:1em;}\n        .error{color:#d32f2f;font-size:0.9em;margin-top:5px;}\n        footer{text-align:center;padding:20px 0;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #e0e0e0;color:#666;font-size:0.9em;}\n        @media (max-width:768px){\n            .section{padding:15px;}\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <header>\n        <h1>家味餐厅 - 预订座位</h1>\n        <nav>\n            <a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n            <a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n            <a href=\"menu.html\">菜单</a>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n        <h2>请填写以下信息进行预订</h2>\n        <form id=\"reservationForm\" action=\"#\" method=\"post\" onsubmit=\"return false;\">\n            <label for=\"name\">姓名</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" required>\n\n            <label for=\"phone\">电话</label>\n            <input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" name=\"phone\" required pattern=\"[0-9]{11}\" placeholder=\"请输入11位手机号\">\n\n            <label for=\"date\">日期</label>\n            <input type=\"date\" id=\"date\" name=\"date\" required>\n\n            <label for=\"time\">时间</label>\n            <input type=\"time\" id=\"time\" name=\"time\" required>\n\n            <label for=\"party\">人数</label>\n            <input type=\"number\" id=\"party\" name=\"party\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" required>\n\n            <label for=\"note\">备注（可选）</label>\n            <textarea id=\"note\" name=\"note\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"特殊需求或留言\"></textarea>\n\n            <div class=\"error\" id=\"errorMsg\"></div>\n\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn\">提交预订</button>\n        </form>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer>\n        © 2025 家味餐厅 · 版权所有\n    </footer>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n    // 简单的前端表单校验示例\n    document.getElementById('reservationForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){\n        e.preventDefault(); // 防止实际提交\n        const phone = document.getElementById('phone').value;\n        const phonePattern = /^[0-9]{11}$/;\n        const errorMsg = document.getElementById('errorMsg');\n        if (!phonePattern.test(phone)) {\n            errorMsg.textContent = '请输入有效的11位手机号';\n            return;\n        }\n        alert('预订表单已收到，我们将在1小时内与您联系确认。');\n    });\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== END OF FILES ====="
